 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API keys and audit (schema 3)
+
+`apiKeys` contains `{ key, name, role }` records; roles are `viewer`, `cook`,
+and `manager`. Schema 2 migrates with empty `apiKeys` and `audit` arrays
+unless these fields already exist. Configure keys before serving old data.
+The seed includes one example key per role.
+
+`audit` is an append-only array of `{ time, name, method, path, status }`
+records for successful HTTP data writes. `time` is an ISO instant and
+`name` identifies the API key without storing its secret. Entries are
+stored in request order and read in reverse order, including tied times.
